WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.291
What knocks people out

00:00:02.291 --> 00:00:03.791
is the risk of ruin.

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:05.791
but we don’t realize

00:00:05.791 --> 00:00:07.791
pain is a great teacher.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.791
In the early eighties,
I made one of the

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:15.958
biggest bets
of my career,

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:17.583
and I couldn't have
been more wrong.

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.500
I lost money for me,

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.791
for my clients.

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:22.625
I was so broke.

00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:25.583
This was a very
painful experience.

00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:29.041
And yet was one of the
big epiphanies in my life.

00:00:29.041 --> 00:00:29.833
Pain

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:31.041
plus reflection

00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:32.833
equals progress.

00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:43.125
This class is for people
who want to

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:46.458
engineer strategies in
investing

00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:48.458
to then achieve
great success.

